{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","id":"pg_b5c76405d1b05027b3d993cebafb6d70","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/gastownhall-gastown-docs-cleanup-md-649b832b7672-93cebafb6d70.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_004c744c012c5a518148a8590df44b35"],"title":"gastownhall/gastown/docs/CLEANUP.md @ 649b832b7672","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1a6749db0581f421d4787ce29ab192635df42fcb68d2d0d582f2274f0075072a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent work state persists in git worktree-based 'Hooks' storage that survives crashes and restarts, and work items are stored in the Beads ledger, a git-backed issue tracking system."},{"claim_ids":["clm_212bd080fbc62bc3b785f35d5e97905a6f69ddd6a4a7653cc55e219cfae559de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Native installs require Git 2.20+, Go 1.26.2+ (per go.mod), Beads (bd) 0.57.0+, sqlite3, ICU4C dev headers for source builds, tmux 3.0+ for tmux-backed roles, and a Claude Code CLI as the default runtime; Docker installs only need Docker Compose."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2676378cc7e03582cdae0c5f020d09cf4c83a85a3be246d134217e3bca93b898"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Bead/issue IDs use a prefix plus 5-character alphanumeric format (e.g. gt-abc12), where the prefix indicates the item's origin or rig; commands like gt sling and gt convoy accept these IDs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_40c914724c4bf780f0fcd63e00b4e037ff5f33902350ea7a31aeb8f05dd137d2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Refinery is a per-rig Bors-style merge queue: polecats run 'gt done' to create MR beads, the Refinery batches them, runs verification gates, and bisects failing batches; polecats never push directly to main."},{"claim_ids":["clm_59af9cd3cecf2693aff698db0088b64986e4c6b9f26915b68ac863c0cf0e2463"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The architecture includes a Mayor AI coordinator, a Town workspace directory (e.g. ~/gt/), per-project Rigs wrapping git repositories, and Polecats (worker agents with persistent identity but ephemeral sessions)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7b80926cc27e77495d454099cf1d7d29ea782c9feb2c5952542f0cc9d9213ffa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A three-tier watchdog system keeps agents healthy: per-rig Witnesses monitor polecats and trigger recovery, the Deacon runs continuous patrol cycles across rigs, and Dogs are dispatched for maintenance tasks like triage."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7d899e87a142e781f732b7f26b82c1906cf2104826e33347f74edc2bf452d1ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Runtime configuration is per-rig via settings/config.json with provider, command, args, and prompt_mode fields; built-in agent presets include claude, gemini, codex, kiro, cursor, auggie, amp, opencode, copilot, pi, and omp."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ef23240f603528346092a158f01701f68925cd9728ad36cbe889cb804e3c7bbd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Wasteland federated coordination network links Gas Towns through DoltHub, and Dolt is a prerequisite on the Linux and Windows install paths."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1a6749db0581f421d4787ce29ab192635df42fcb68d2d0d582f2274f0075072a","clm_212bd080fbc62bc3b785f35d5e97905a6f69ddd6a4a7653cc55e219cfae559de","clm_2676378cc7e03582cdae0c5f020d09cf4c83a85a3be246d134217e3bca93b898","clm_40c914724c4bf780f0fcd63e00b4e037ff5f33902350ea7a31aeb8f05dd137d2","clm_59af9cd3cecf2693aff698db0088b64986e4c6b9f26915b68ac863c0cf0e2463","clm_7b80926cc27e77495d454099cf1d7d29ea782c9feb2c5952542f0cc9d9213ffa","clm_7d899e87a142e781f732b7f26b82c1906cf2104826e33347f74edc2bf452d1ca","clm_ef23240f603528346092a158f01701f68925cd9728ad36cbe889cb804e3c7bbd"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","id":"pg_d3386abd911451c7ba74a575d1874b6f","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/gastownhall-gastown-readme-md-649b832b7672-a575d1874b6f.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"title":"gastownhall/gastown/README.md @ 649b832b7672","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
